1
00:00:00,822 --> 00:00:03,362
(Sheldon:)- Penny.
- Come on. They would be so cute on me.

2
00:00:03,575 --> 00:00:05,915
Ah! They'd go great with this sweater.

3
00:00:06,119 --> 00:00:09,919
I don't think Mother Teresa would...
Oh, that is adorable.

4
00:00:22,427 --> 00:00:23,637
(Jimmy:)- Leonard?
- Yeah?

5
00:00:23,845 --> 00:00:28,685
(Sheldon:)In case it comes up again,
this right here is an imposition.

6
00:00:31,019 --> 00:00:33,559
(Leonard:)What was I supposed to do?
He needed a place to sleep.

7
00:00:33,772 --> 00:00:38,232
(Sheldon:)You're soft. This world's
gonna chew you up and spit you out.

8
00:00:42,030 --> 00:00:44,370
(Jimmy(belching):)When did I have tacos?

9
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,490
(Leonard:)Morning, Jimmy.

10
00:00:46,702 --> 00:00:49,282
(Sheldon:)Oh, there it is. Tacos.

11
00:00:51,832 --> 00:00:54,292
- Man, I tied one on.
- Yeah, you did.

12
00:00:54,501 --> 00:00:57,631
So, uh, Iisten,
it was great to see you again.

13
00:00:57,838 --> 00:01:00,088
(Leonard:)And thanks for the apology.

